From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:03:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rewrite frontend to match the DoerToughMoney pivot backend

Replaces the Pay/Request/dispute/identity-verification/old-bank-linking UI
with a tabbed personal-finance shell (Home, Accounts via Plaid,
Transactions, Bills, Budgets, Goals, Insights, DealTough) plus the existing
Shared/group-expense screens. SettleSheet drops the transfer/speed branch
for a cash-only record. Terms/Privacy and PWA branding updated to match.
